{"version":1,"key":"article:36","content":{"id":36,"title":"Git 对象初相识","author":"","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f2c37b19-498a-4606-9b0e-8d94fd09a15f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Git 对象，四种类型的对象："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"1279b7a8-2166-4ca5-968d-2612e20175d9","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"cfd5b8d5-1027-4d5c-b0cb-76a522cab321","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"90ae6037-5ca9-4702-b357-6c939591b24a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"9c96e55b-a5f4-4450-bd84-48f856e8178b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6ee36b7-32ff-46ca-9bb9-0a33cf36b123","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"5f22f0b8-da47-42a4-bcdb-c73fbcfe8293","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0dc19bb7-1b2e-48f2-9a8e-056163ae19d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0128b52b-7a6f-4f60-aeee-e37dbbdf7d65","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"46ffa867-fedc-49a4-a182-1b0a26340a93","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tag"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"94725f38-a2b3-45e0-995e-eef9afaa9153","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"blob 对象"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"67686616-69f4-427e-bff2-7fcf08c343f9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所有的文件都会被存储为一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，需要注意的是，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象只存储文件的内容，对于文件的其它信息，例如文件名，修改时间，权限等等信息均不存储（会被存储到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象中），因此，如果两个文件拥有相同的内容，那么只会有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 文件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e66da9f-dcb4-405f-8548-b24c42289c2e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"新建一个仓库，然后添加两个文件，拥有相同的内容："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"bb6d7649-c299-4935-acae-3c0322e73e85","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ef52d542-39a2-4112-9fe9-5e01992157d1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 创建目录，并初始化\nxt in ~ λ mkdir git-demo\nxt in ~ λ cd git-demo\nxt in ~/git-demo λ git init\nInitialized empty Git repository in /home/xt/git-demo/.git/\n\n# 创建两个文件 a.txt b.txt 含有相同的内容\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ echo \"Hello World\" > a.txt\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ echo \"Hello World\" > b.txt\n# 查看 Git 对象，此时没有 Git 对象\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ tree -a .git/objects\n.git/objects\n├── info\n└── pack","collabId":"3ca9c38c-f728-4382-b6f8-b95f37946f59","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1bbb2a26-5b60-4575-b53d-5b76e711937a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"将两个文件添加到暂存区，然后查看 Git 对象的数量"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"b8eee0ff-658f-424f-9be5-8dfdd079d8c2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"5ddff2d7-c6f0-4fc7-86c2-70653c52ac2e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ git add .\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ tree -a .git/objects\n.git/objects\n├── 55\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 7db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\n├── info\n└── pack\n\n3 directories, 1 file","collabId":"7ed83f7f-e66f-479a-af2f-9f9b903210be","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a011b176-4466-41e6-9614-21083dcdcfed","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此时会发现产生了一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"55"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的文件夹，包含一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"7db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的文件，其实二者应该合为一体看 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"557db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，这串字符串就是这个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"id"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，我们统称为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"oid(Object ID)"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。这个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"oid"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是使用算法生成的，它可以保证不同的内容有不同的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"oid"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，相同的内容有着相同的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"oid"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9273d161-31d5-4c70-8037-a2684da4f96d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"git hash-object"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 命令查看内容相对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"oid"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"375d2581-f4dc-437a-a234-2252d911f598","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0caa5f48-e8e4-4388-919a-7e97a4bff824","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ echo \"Hello World\" | git hash-object --stdin\n557db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238","collabId":"8fa6630c-d287-43bc-9196-47038d45d43b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f22289b6-0c04-4923-bdd1-0527a62e8635","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了防止一个文件夹下的文件更多，以 oid 的前两位划分文件夹，将对象划分到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"00-ff"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 共 256 个文件夹中。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f6a13d4a-681b-490d-9113-526fc2470070","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果直接查看 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的内容，会发现不是以文本形式存储的"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"f068f9d5-41d0-41cc-a1da-23db1ff4cd37","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"23bd78a1-7aeb-4677-b6a2-7fc8c8bf14da","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ cat .git/objects/55/7db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\nx\u0001K��OR04b�H����/�I�\u0002A�\u0006I%","collabId":"3511a30a-8786-4530-902e-49c83fcb9f11","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"b189f3ef-9696-4e8f-ad2d-482b3b044722","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这是因为 Git 使用了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"zlib"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对文本内容和对象的头信息(header) 进行了压缩, 为了真实还原我们存储的文本内容, 我们可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"git cat-file"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 子命令来查看"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"b4d99087-dd93-453d-b71b-7215a9aefaa4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"47263c54-5f65-499a-9c86-1b33deea9d56","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# -p 查看文件内容，并以美观的方式对文件内容进行输出\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p 557db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\nHello World\n# -t 查看文件类型\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -t 557db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\nblob","collabId":"7833d1a8-8794-4e16-8aba-27ca6c2924dd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"1547851b-6188-4053-ba14-834414f0f053","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tree 对象"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a21d5e5a-0a70-4d0b-9b66-41428aa35e9a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果文件对应到 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，那么文件夹对应到的就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree "},{"type":"formatted","text":"对象，文件夹中包含的文件信息（文件名、修改时间等）均存储在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree "},{"type":"formatted","text":"对象中。而我们的工作区就是一个 tree 对象，我们称为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"root-tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象中可以包含 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3e9ea5a2-5f00-4b19-af60-892d6fc26ee7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们执行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"git commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的时候，Git 会生成一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象来存储当前工作区的快照，这个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"root-tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，可以根据 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"root-tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 推演出该仓库的所有内容"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"3d52e693-1496-4214-a2de-214f99ed21f9","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"50d965f5-4c0e-4571-9574-053afe1ec3e9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 创建一个文件夹 src，并新增一个文件 hello.txt\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ mkdir src\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ echo \"Hello\" > src/hello.txt\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ tree\n.\n├── a.txt\n├── b.txt\n└── src\n    └── hello.txt\n\n1 directory, 3 files\n\n# 添加到仓库中\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git add .\n# 出现了一个新的 blob 对象，对应 hello.txt 的内容\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ tree -a .git/objects\n.git/objects\n├── 55\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 7db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\n├── e9\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 65047ad7c57865823c7d992b1d046ea66edf78\n├── info\n└── pack\n\n4 directories, 2 files","collabId":"b4e7231d-e14d-4bf1-81a1-f7ec2e49b8fc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"69742d06-9277-46a6-8a76-a88695ed09cd","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"进行一次提交"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"49dff3d2-ba44-417f-bc9a-7f7da2764476","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"8ddc50af-6486-4e50-b827-05824dfabbb8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 进行一次提交\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git commit -am \"first commit\"\n[master (root-commit) 94f8403] first commit\n 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+)\n create mode 100644 a.txt\n create mode 100644 b.txt\n create mode 100644 src/hello.txt\n# 查看对象\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ tree -a .git/objects\n.git/objects\n├── 1f\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 8946efd983ef493e28de287f5af69f862a6728\n├── 55\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 7db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\n├── 8c\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 3c7fbcd903744b20fd7567a1fcefa99133b5bc\n├── 94\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── f840300469b623c45d1c92ae1edbc2c39c466d\n├── e9\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 65047ad7c57865823c7d992b1d046ea66edf78\n├── info\n└── pack\n\n7 directories, 5 files","collabId":"7c837d93-ebf7-41ea-94ae-9dbfc3fccc76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"738dfa26-9422-45b6-bd3e-475dcd823430","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以看到新增了三个对象，分别是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象和两个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"567f54de-0ea0-42cf-a370-5d243a0589c8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"2f516b97-33f0-4e5e-a67a-c3fba92845cc","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"# 查看 commit 对象信息，包含 root-tree 对象的 oid\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p master\ntree 1f8946efd983ef493e28de287f5af69f862a6728\nauthor LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677897217 +0800\ncommitter LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677897217 +0800\n\nfirst commit\n\n# 查看 root-tree 对象的内容\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p 1f8946efd983ef493e28de287f5af69f862a6728\n100644 blob 557db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238    a.txt\n100644 blob 557db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238    b.txt\n040000 tree 8c3c7fbcd903744b20fd7567a1fcefa99133b5bc    src\n# 查看 src 对应 tree 对象的内容\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p 8c3c7fbcd903744b20fd7567a1fcefa99133b5bc\n100644 blob e965047ad7c57865823c7d992b1d046ea66edf78    hello.txt","collabId":"ef06c3d3-906f-467f-8d09-80e7f73d769c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"62cace51-e1d6-4aa6-a113-eeef83d89e85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"commit 对象"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"270c751e-fc61-4ac6-901d-0893604b25e0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 记录了仓库的内容快照，但是还缺少一些信息，比如提交者，提交信息，提交时间，关联快照。这就需要 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"f75c4d2f-0501-45f5-8036-4ad2bd325c0e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"7863bd1e-534e-4de5-9efb-40da68c248aa","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p master\ntree 1f8946efd983ef493e28de287f5af69f862a6728\nauthor LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677897217 +0800\ncommitter LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677897217 +0800\n\nfirst commit","collabId":"196da6c0-9b7e-48eb-8ad6-f931641f19bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"25b1e5a7-ae98-4f83-b6ad-e9b4a5f8bd7f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0e9e24c4-d4fd-4d29-bc3d-02c5f305be1a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ echo \"# Readme\" > README.md\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git add .\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git commit -am \"second commit\"\n[master 90643a9] second commit\n 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)\n create mode 100644 README.md\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ tree -a .git/objects\n.git/objects\n├── 1f\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 8946efd983ef493e28de287f5af69f862a6728\n├── 55\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 7db03de997c86a4a028e1ebd3a1ceb225be238\n├── 68\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 181b61e87b8766a6be442bf8ea52629308cbbf\n├── 8c\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 3c7fbcd903744b20fd7567a1fcefa99133b5bc\n├── 90\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 643a9ce0571aa37d5603cf861ae223796b84c8\n├── 94\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── f840300469b623c45d1c92ae1edbc2c39c466d\n├── e9\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 65047ad7c57865823c7d992b1d046ea66edf78\n├── f3\n│&nbsp;&nbsp; └── 954314c1026028e77ea3a765aadefa67b45195\n├── info\n└── pack\n\n10 directories, 8 files\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p master\ntree 68181b61e87b8766a6be442bf8ea52629308cbbf\nparent 94f840300469b623c45d1c92ae1edbc2c39c466d\nauthor LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677902228 +0800\ncommitter LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677902228 +0800\n\nsecond commit","collabId":"c220ac8a-c108-4fe1-96e2-088a984f397e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4e36ed61-ed3f-4ee5-baa3-7e6227447d3c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二次提交发现新增了三个 Git 对象，分别是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"root-tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，还有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象对应新建的 README.md 文件。从第二个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象中，我们可以看到提交的信息，包括作者，提交者，提交时间和提交信息，还能看到关联的提交 parent，指向了前一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"acb4de8e-05cc-4813-a3c7-c53c9e107ac4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果用一张图解释当前的 Git 对象的关系，应当如下所示"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/Git%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1.69r1dw9bjcc0.png","previewUrl":"https://github.com/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022/raw/master/Git%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1.69r1dw9bjcc0.png","width":720,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"c94d25f8-5360-48ba-9730-2ff894e5718c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac525957-afd7-4df4-8900-657b996a6c5d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Git 是基于快照的版本管理，而不是基于增量，这就意味着如果你修改了文件，然后进行了提交，那么会生成一个新的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象，相应的，包含该修改文件的文件夹对应的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tree"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象也会重新生成。这就会带来一个问题，如果频繁的进行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的话，就会导致 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"blob"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的数目急剧增大，虽然频繁 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是个好习惯，但是希望在进行 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"push"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 或合并之前，合并一下多个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，减少 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 个数。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"25e03457-d62b-4c6f-9924-abda137bd52c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"tag"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"08bd973c-3f81-4867-9403-db965edd6bb0","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tag"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 通常用来记录被认为很重要的提交, 例如软件的发行版本。我们可以创建一个不带有任何额外信息的"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":" tag"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，Git 称这种类型的标签为轻量级 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tag"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"6ee70929-b799-4f39-af4e-7d677ad837e7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"58d7085d-714d-4c4b-93b8-f9d8dfb2c1a6","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ git tag v1.0\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -t v1.0\ncommit","collabId":"cd61079a-a027-40b0-ae60-aa2c697d53b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"8923c393-805a-4742-a6af-358b01668110","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"轻量级 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tag"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象无异，它不会保存额外的信息，就是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3d98bb43-93b2-447f-8083-1618b873ec3f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另一种标签称为附注标签，可以添加额外的信息，比如标签作者，邮箱等等，它是一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tag"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"0842f143-581a-4e27-878d-f3c9f9d72b4b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"dc87b9b7-62ca-40d9-93ef-35fc0100c1c4","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"xt in ~/git-demo on master λ git tag -a v2.0 -m \"v2.0\"\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -t v2.0\ntag\nxt in ~/git-demo on master λ git cat-file -p v2.0\nobject b9e8d5d9952aea0baac5c19f4ebad48ba623b5f4\ntype commit\ntag v2.0\ntagger LastKnightCoder <lastknightcoder@gmail.com> 1677910987 +0800\n\nv2.0","collabId":"04e36260-2cbf-41d5-995b-97b1ab506894","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddd9a9f6-2edd-4e03-b92a-0ba20b73f157","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"tag"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象中除了保存了指向的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"commit"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"oid"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，还保存了标签的一些信息。"}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","collabId":"cdda984f-490c-4905-8669-5f7dca47853b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"7f12795d-4213-478b-87b1-96d839397929","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"c1368a02-c835-4505-bca1-02647b724660","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c6685afe-46ff-4483-9393-fdbbe372e486","children":[{"type":"link","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/UTETcreecYfotJzlR1fAkw","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","collabId":"ae222842-dacf-43e5-a117-46e36584e6e9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"15分钟学会如何找到对象！阿里云程序员详解Git对象和引用原理"}]}]}]}]}],"tags":[],"bannerBg":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/wallhaven-3zvv3d_46d18b15-f245-4aac-b365-5a94c7b54b42.jpg","createTime":1704639871102,"updateTime":1775869682970},"meta":{"type":"article","publishTime":1775869682970}}